          {
            "title": "Question: Intro 3",
            "id": 89955,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa perbedaan antara list yang disimpan dalam <code>ids_a</code> dan <code>ids_b</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"ids = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;X12&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;M45&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Z10&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"ids_a = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;0&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + value \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" value \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ids]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(ids_a)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"ids_b = []\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" value \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ids:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  new_value = \" /><text value=\"&quot;1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + value\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  ids_b.append(new_value)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(ids_b)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"['0X12', '0M45', '0Z10']\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"['1X12', '1M45', '1Z10']\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Nilai dalam <code>ids_a</code> diawali dengan <code>\"0\"</code>, sedangkan nilai dalam <code>ids_b</code> diawali dengan <code>\"1\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Tidak ada perbedaan, keduanya setara</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Berbeda dengan <code>ids_a</code>, <code>ids_b</code> menyimpan sebuah list</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Nilai dalam <code>ids_a</code> diawali dengan <code>\"0\"</code>, sedangkan nilai dalam <code>ids_b</code> diawali dengan <code>\"1\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Misalkan <code>ids</code> juga berisi <code>\"Q7\"</code> sebelum kode ini dijalankan. Item baru mana yang muncul?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"ids = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;X12&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;M45&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Z10&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"ids_a = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;0&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + value \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" value \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ids]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(ids_a)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"ids_b = []\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" value \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ids:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  new_value = \" /><text value=\"&quot;1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + value\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  ids_b.append(new_value)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(ids_b)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"['0X12', '0M45', '0Z10']\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"['1X12', '1M45', '1Z10']\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">ids_a mendapat 0Q7, dan ids_b mendapat 1Q7</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">ids_a mendapat 1Q7, dan ids_b mendapat 0Q7</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">ids_a dan ids_b sama-sama mendapat Q7 tanpa awalan</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">ids_a mendapat 0Q7, dan ids_b mendapat 1Q7.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Square brackets",
            "id": 89957,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang salah dengan kode ini?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"answers = [\" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"opposite = {\" /><text value=\"not\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" answer \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" answer \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" answers}\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">List comprehension harus diapit oleh tanda kurung siku <code>[]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Tidak ada yang salah dengan kodenya</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>not answer</code> bukan ekspresi yang valid</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">List comprehension harus diapit oleh tanda kurung siku <code>[]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kamu perlu membuat <code>opposite</code> menjadi list yang mempertahankan urutan asli. Perbaikan mana yang mencapainya?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"answers = [\" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"opposite = {\" /><text value=\"not\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" answer \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" answer \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" answers}\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ganti kurung kurawal dengan kurung siku</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Pertahankan kurung kurawal dan hapus not</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Ganti not answer dengan answers</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ganti kurung kurawal dengan kurung siku.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: For loop",
            "id": 89958,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang salah dengan kode ini?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"prices = [\" /><text value=\"13.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"10.99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"reduced = [price - \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prices]\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Loop for harus berupa <code>for price in prices</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Tidak ada yang salah dengan kode ini</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Tidak ada variabel <code>prices</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Loop for harus berupa <code>for price in prices</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Penggantian mana yang membuat <code>reduced</code> berisi satu nilai untuk setiap item dalam <code>prices</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"prices = [\" /><text value=\"13.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"10.99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"reduced = [price - \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prices]\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>[price - 1 for price in prices]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>[price - 1 for prices]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>[prices - 1 for price in prices]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>[price - 1 for price in prices]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Intro 3",
            "id": 89961,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kodekan sebuah ekspresi di dalam list comprehension ini untuk <code>matcha_2</code>, sehingga menghasilkan list yang sama seperti yang ada di <code>matcha_1</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"bundle = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla latte&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla scone&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"matcha_1 = []\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" item \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bundle:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  update = item.replace(\" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;matcha&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  matcha_1.append(update)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"matcha_2 = [item.replace(\" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;matcha&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" item \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bundle]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(matcha_1)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(matcha_2)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"164\" endIndex=\"168\" /><option startIndex=\"168\" endIndex=\"176\" /><option startIndex=\"176\" endIndex=\"197\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(&quot;matcha&quot;, &quot;vanilla&quot;)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['matcha latte', 'matcha scone']\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"['matcha latte', 'matcha scone']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>item</code>, diikuti oleh <code>.replace</code>, dan terakhir <code>(\"vanilla\", \"matcha\")</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lengkapi kedua bentuk agar mengubah setiap item <code>vanilla</code> menjadi item <code>matcha</code> dan membuat list yang sama.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"bundle = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla latte&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla scone&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"matcha_1 = []\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" item \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bundle:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  update = item.replace(\" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;matcha&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  matcha_1.append(update)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"matcha_2 = [item.replace(\" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;matcha&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" item \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bundle]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(matcha_1)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(matcha_2)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"164\" endIndex=\"168\" /><option startIndex=\"168\" endIndex=\"176\" /><option startIndex=\"176\" endIndex=\"197\" /><option startIndex=\"142\" endIndex=\"148\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(&quot;matcha&quot;, &quot;vanilla&quot;)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"bundle\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['matcha latte', 'matcha scone']\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"['matcha latte', 'matcha scone']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>update</code>, diikuti oleh <code>item</code>, <code>.replace</code>, dan terakhir <code>(\"vanilla\", \"matcha\")</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Copy",
            "id": 89973,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buat kode ekspresi agar list comprehension membuat salinan dari list <code>passwords</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"passwords = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;12345&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;XhJ%%M&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"copy = [password \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" password \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" passwords]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(copy)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"49\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['12345', 'XhJ%%M']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>password</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Return statement",
            "id": 90011,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Manakah dari fungsi-fungsi berikut yang dapat kita gunakan di dalam list comprehension?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"multiply\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(num_1, num_2)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  num_1 * num_2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"divide\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(number, divisor)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number/divisor\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"add\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(num_1, num_2)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(num_1 + num_2)\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Hanya <code>divide(number, divisor)</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ketiganya</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Hanya <code>divide(number, divisor)</code> dan <code>add(num_1, num_2)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Hanya <code>divide(number, divisor)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fungsi harus mengembalikan hasil perhitungannya agar hasil tersebut dapat menjadi item list.</p><p>Jika kamu mengganti isi <code>multiply()</code> dengan <code>return num_1 * num_2</code>, fungsi mana yang mengembalikan hasil perhitungan?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"multiply\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(num_1, num_2)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  num_1 * num_2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"divide\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(number, divisor)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number/divisor\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"add\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(num_1, num_2)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(num_1 + num_2)\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">multiply dan divide</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Hanya divide</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">multiply, divide, dan add</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih multiply dan divide.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Function 2",
            "id": 90015,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Di dalam fungsi <code>apply_taxes()</code>, pertama-tama hitung pajak pertambahan nilai <code>vat</code>, lalu bea, dan kembalikan <code>price</code> ditambah <code>vat</code> dan <code>duties</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"prices = [\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"450\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"27\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"apply_taxes\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(price)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  vat = \" /><text value=\"0.15\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" * price\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  duties = \" /><text value=\"0.20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" * price\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price + vat + duties\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"tax_inclusive = [apply_taxes(price) \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prices]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(tax_inclusive)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"102\" /><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"123\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[135.0, 607.5, 36.45]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>vat = 0.15 * price</code>, diikuti oleh <code>duties = 0.20 * price</code>, lalu <code>return</code>, <code>price + vat + duties</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Pertama, hitung <code>vat</code> sebesar 15% dari price, lalu <code>duties</code> sebesar 20%, kemudian kembalikan price ditambah keduanya.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"prices = [\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"450\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"27\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"apply_taxes\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(price)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  vat = \" /><text value=\"0.15\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" * price\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  duties = \" /><text value=\"0.20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" * price\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price + vat + duties\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"tax_inclusive = [apply_taxes(price) \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prices]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(tax_inclusive)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"102\" /><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"123\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"vat = 0.15 + price\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[135.0, 607.5, 36.45]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>vat = 0.15 * price</code>, diikuti oleh <code>duties = 0.20 * price</code>, <code>return</code>, dan terakhir <code>price + vat + duties</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Function as an expression",
            "id": 90013,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gunakan <code>exchange()</code> untuk menukar setiap nilai <code>amount</code> dalam list <code>savings</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"savings = [\" /><text value=\"120\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"300\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"exchange\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(dollars)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  euros = \" /><text value=\"0.8\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" * dollars\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  comission = \" /><text value=\"0.1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" * euros\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" euros - comission\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"euros = [exchange(amount) \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" amount \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" savings]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(euros)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"136\" endIndex=\"152\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[86.4, 216.0, 36.0]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>exchange(amount)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Multiple expressions",
            "id": 90010,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Periksa apakah password memiliki tanda <code>\"%\"</code>, lalu periksa <code>\"&amp;\"</code>, dan terakhir kembalikan <code>True</code> jika <code>percent</code> atau <code>and_sign</code> bernilai <code>True</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"passwords = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;012345&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Xhf!%m0&amp;&amp;&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"is_valid\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(password)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  percent = password.count(\" /><text value=\"&quot;%&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  and_sign = password.count(\" /><text value=\"&quot;&amp;&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" percent \" /><text value=\"or\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" and_sign\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"valid = [is_valid(password) \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" password \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" passwords]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(valid)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"96\" /><option startIndex=\"110\" endIndex=\"133\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"percent and and_sign\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"143\" endIndex=\"162\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[False, True]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>password.count(\"%\") &gt; 0</code>, diikuti oleh <code>password.count(\"&amp;\") &gt; 0</code>, dan terakhir <code>percent or and_sign</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Periksa apakah password memiliki <code>\"%\"</code>, lalu <code>\"&amp;\"</code>, dan kembalikan <code>True</code> jika <strong>salah satunya</strong> ada.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"passwords = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;012345&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Xhf!%m0&amp;&amp;&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"is_valid\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(password)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  percent = password.count(\" /><text value=\"&quot;%&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  and_sign = password.count(\" /><text value=\"&quot;&amp;&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" percent \" /><text value=\"or\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" and_sign\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"valid = [is_valid(password) \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" password \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" passwords]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(valid)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"96\" /><option startIndex=\"110\" endIndex=\"133\" /><option startIndex=\"143\" endIndex=\"162\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"password.count(&quot;%&quot;) == 0\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[False, True]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>password.count(\"%\") &gt; 0</code>, diikuti oleh <code>password.count(\"&amp;\") &gt; 0</code>, dan terakhir <code>percent or and_sign</code>.</p></body></html>"
