            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang dilakukan oleh pernyataan if di dalam list comprehension ini?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"passwords = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;012345&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Xhf!%m0&amp;&amp;&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;password!!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"valid = [password \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" password \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" passwords \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" password.count(\" /><text value=\"&quot;!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(valid)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"['Xhf!%m0&amp;&amp;', 'password!!']\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Memastikan password hanya disalin jika setidaknya mengandung <code>\"!\"</code> sekali</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ini memastikan password hanya disalin jika tidak mengandung <code>\"!\"</code> apa pun</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Kode ini tidak melakukan apa pun karena kodenya tidak benar</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Memastikan password hanya disalin jika setidaknya mengandung <code>\"!\"</code> sekali.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Klausa <code>if</code> memfilter elemen yang masuk ke list baru.</p><p>Jika kondisinya diubah menjadi <code>password.count(\"!\") == 1</code>, password mana yang disalin?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"passwords = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;012345&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Xhf!%m0&amp;&amp;&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;password!!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"valid = [password \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" password \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" passwords \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" password.count(\" /><text value=\"&quot;!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(valid)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"['Xhf!%m0&amp;&amp;', 'password!!']\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Hanya <code>Xhf!%m0&amp;&amp;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Hanya <code>password!!</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Xhf!%m0&amp;&amp;</code> dan <code>password!!</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih Hanya <code>Xhf!%m0&amp;&amp;</code>.</p></body></html>"
