          {
            "title": "Example: Condition",
            "id": 90597,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buat conditional yang memeriksa apakah <code>\"open\"</code> terdapat dalam nama <code>wifi</code> setidaknya sekali.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"networks = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;open-WIFI&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;guest&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Wi-Fly&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"open_networks = [wifi \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" wifi \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" networks \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" wifi.count(\" /><text value=\"&quot;open&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(open_networks)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"95\" /><option startIndex=\"95\" endIndex=\"109\" /><option startIndex=\"110\" endIndex=\"111\" /><option startIndex=\"112\" endIndex=\"113\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['open-WIFI']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>if</code>, diikuti oleh <code>wifi</code>, lalu <code>.count(\"open\")</code>, <code>&gt;</code>, <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Pertahankan hanya jaringan yang nama <code>wifi</code>-nya berisi <code>\"open\"</code> setidaknya satu kali.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"networks = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;open-WIFI&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;guest&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Wi-Fly&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"open_networks = [wifi \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" wifi \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" networks \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" wifi.count(\" /><text value=\"&quot;open&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(open_networks)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"95\" /><option startIndex=\"95\" endIndex=\"109\" /><option startIndex=\"110\" endIndex=\"111\" /><option startIndex=\"112\" endIndex=\"113\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".count(&quot;guest&quot;)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['open-WIFI']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>if</code>, diikuti oleh <code>wifi</code>, <code>.count(\"open\")</code>, <code>&gt;</code>, dan terakhir <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>",
